{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sequencer is a puzzle game about the main character (The Sequencer) who finds himself in a strange world where his only goal is to solve puzzles. The puzzles increase in difficulty and challenge the player to find the right solutions. The game's theme is solving puzzles by performing sequential steps with little input or instructions.\u00a0 This makes the game challenging because in many cases the next step is unknown.\u00a0 The player must intuitively perceive what should happen next. Anyone can play, but not everyone will be able to solve all of the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving puzzles by moving cubes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569250?t=1745197767","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569250?t=1745197767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569250/dd18e0515f716a718e14f5cc3e6d483a0dcd52a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745197767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569250/dd18e0515f716a718e14f5cc3e6d483a0dcd52a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745197767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sequencer is a puzzle game about the main character (The Sequencer) who finds himself in a strange world where his only goal is to solve puzzles. The puzzles increase in difficulty and challenge the player to find the right solutions. The game's theme is solving puzzles by performing sequential steps with little input or instructions.\u00